  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, whisk together curry paste, fish sauce, brown sugar, and lime juice.",
    "2. Add lamb cubes to the marinade, mixing well to coat.",
    "3. Cover and refrigerate for at least 2 hours or overnight.",
    "4. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "5. Thread lamb cubes and onions onto skewers, brushing with vegetable oil.",
    "6. Grill lamb kebabs for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "7. Garnish with fresh Thai basil and chili peppers.",
    "8. Serve hot with steamed rice."
